## 4. 技术指标库设计

### 4.1 统一类型

```go
// indicator/types.go

type Kline struct {
    OpenTime int64
    Open     float64
    High     float64
    Low      float64
    Close    float64
    Volume   float64
}

type IndicatorResult struct {
    Current float64     `json:"current"`
    Series  []float64   `json:"series,omitempty"`
}

type MACDResult struct {
    MACD      float64 `json:"macd"`
    Signal    float64 `json:"signal"`
    Histogram float64 `json:"histogram"`
    Cross     string  `json:"cross,omitempty"` // "up"/"down"/"none"
    Series    []struct {
        MACD   float64 `json:"macd"`
        Signal float64 `json:"signal"`
        Hist   float64 `json:"histogram"`
    } `json:"series,omitempty"`
}
```

### 4.2 指标清单（12个）

| 指标 | 函数签名 | 参数 |
|---|---|---|
| SMA | `SMA(klines, period)` → `IndicatorResult` | period |
| EMA | `EMA(klines, period)` → `IndicatorResult` | period |
| MACD | `MACD(klines, fast, slow, signal)` → `MACDResult` | 12/26/9 |
| RSI | `RSI(klines, period)` → `IndicatorResult` | 7/14 |
| Bollinger | `Bollinger(klines, period, mult)` → `{Upper,Middle,Lower}` | 20/2.0 |
| ATR | `ATR(klines, period)` → `IndicatorResult` | 14 |
| Stochastic | `Stochastic(klines, k, d)` → `{K, D}` | 14/3 |
| OBV | `OBV(klines)` → `[]float64` | - |
| VWAP | `VWAP(klines)` → `[]float64` | - |
| ADX | `ADX(klines, period)` → `{ADX, PlusDI, MinusDI}` | 14 |
| Ichimoku | `Ichimoku(klines)` → `{Tenkan, Kijun, SenkouA, SenkouB, Chikou}` | - |
| MFI | `MFI(klines, period)` → `IndicatorResult` | 14 |

